{
  "about": "GlassineOS design tokens: the single source of truth for the documentation theme (and, later, the shell). One structure, three voices (White, Editorial, Stationery), three pens per voice, three schemes (Paper, Night, E-ink). hooks/tokens.py turns this file into the --gl-* CSS variables at build time. Values are CSS; {name} refers to another token of the same voice and scheme and becomes var(--gl-name). 'bridge' lists, for each docs variable, the shell theme keys it corresponds to.",
